# Opalescence on an enchantment that is a creature already: Fear of Missing Out is a printed 2/3 Enchantment Creature
# of mana value 2. "Each other non-Aura enchantment ... has base power and base toughness each equal to its mana value"
# applies to it too, and its layer-7b value replaces the printed one (CR 613.4b; the printed values are the copiable
# values of layer 1): a 2/2, where it would stay 2/3 if Opalescence left creatures alone. Its enters trigger (discard a
# card, then draw) has no bearing on its size.

